# Gmail SMTP Configuration for JAK Website Leads
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on your Google Account: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate a 16-character App Password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Fill in your Gmail and App Password below in your .env.local file

GMAIL_USER=jakdesigns2017@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_16_char_app_password

# Where leads will be delivered (can be the same as GMAIL_USER or a different team email)
CONTACT_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=jakdesigns2017@gmail.com
